WEBVTT

00:11.790 --> 00:13.030
Five hundred years ago,

00:13.050 --> 00:15.810
the war between gods and demons shattered the celestial ladder.

00:16.550 --> 00:17.910
The left hand of Deity Taihe,

00:17.910 --> 00:19.670
which concentrated the power of all gods,

00:19.790 --> 00:21.270
fell into the mortal world.

00:21.950 --> 00:24.150
Having lost his primordial divine power,

00:24.160 --> 00:26.930
he was lost in the void, unable to awaken.

00:27.190 --> 00:29.180
The Divine Realm weakened as a result.

00:29.390 --> 00:31.990
Gods fell one after another,

00:32.820 --> 00:35.550
and the mortal world was cut off from the Divine Realm.

00:35.700 --> 00:37.060
Only the human race

00:37.090 --> 00:40.490
and two immortal clans, the Youhu Clan and the War Demons,

00:40.800 --> 00:42.880
stayed in the mortal world.

02:14.520 --> 02:17.770
[A Moment But Forever]

02:18.940 --> 02:20.670
[Episode 1]

02:21.990 --> 02:23.220
My name is Ji Tanyin.

02:23.630 --> 02:25.870
People also call me Goddess Wushuang.

02:26.870 --> 02:28.150
A thousand years ago, I ascended to the Divine Realm

02:28.150 --> 02:29.300
through my craftsmanship.

02:29.460 --> 02:31.100
As the creator of the divine hand,

02:31.310 --> 02:33.310
I went to the mortal world to search for it.

02:33.700 --> 02:35.230
However, with the celestial ladder shattered

02:35.260 --> 02:36.780
and the passage between realms destroyed,

02:37.190 --> 02:38.900
I was severely injured as I passed through

02:38.900 --> 02:40.030
the Sea of Flux.

02:40.430 --> 02:41.950
After a near-death experience,

02:42.079 --> 02:43.400
I was trapped on Wu Mountain.

02:45.090 --> 02:46.050
After I woke up,

02:46.430 --> 02:47.630
I learned that the Youhu Clan

02:47.660 --> 02:49.829
had produced a prodigious young man.

02:49.850 --> 02:50.650
I suspected

02:50.680 --> 02:52.579
that the Divine Hand might be in his possession.

02:52.610 --> 02:54.329
So I rushed to the Pinghu battlefield.

03:11.870 --> 03:12.870
That young man was indeed

03:12.870 --> 03:14.350
the new host of the Divine Hand.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.630
However, he couldn't

03:15.630 --> 03:17.380
fully control the power of the Divine Hand yet.

03:19.430 --> 03:20.190
Stop!

03:27.100 --> 03:28.100
With a single strike,

03:28.120 --> 03:30.590
he nearly shattered the entire Pinghu.

03:30.790 --> 03:31.670
To save lives,

03:31.690 --> 03:32.940
I intercepted half of his attack,

03:32.970 --> 03:34.480
sustaining severe injuries myself.

03:34.590 --> 03:35.790
Along with half of Pinghu,

03:35.790 --> 03:37.150
I sank into the sea.

03:40.310 --> 03:40.950
Tanyin.

03:42.210 --> 03:42.850
Tanyin.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.750
You must go to Fangwai Mountain

03:44.780 --> 03:46.190
to retrieve the Divine Left Hand.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.950
The High Priest of Youhu Clan

03:47.950 --> 03:49.270
is a brutal and violent person.

03:49.300 --> 03:50.950
He's unworthy of being the Divine Hand's host.

03:51.130 --> 03:52.490
We can't wait any longer.

04:02.300 --> 04:03.100
Now,

04:02.630 --> 04:06.110
[Youhu Clan] [Fangwai Mountain]

04:03.570 --> 04:05.360
the human race became dependent on the Youhu Clan.

04:05.530 --> 04:06.730
Every year, they offer tribute,

04:07.060 --> 04:08.410
providing treasures and young girls

04:08.460 --> 04:09.650
to enter Fangwai Immortal Mountain

04:09.650 --> 04:10.970
as slaves and servants.

04:11.780 --> 04:12.580
And this

04:13.100 --> 04:15.180
is also the best opportunity for me to enter the mountain.

04:35.860 --> 04:37.450
Shen Ying, the envoy from the human race,

04:36.340 --> 04:38.620
[Foreign Affairs Scribe of the human race, Shen Ying]

04:37.450 --> 04:39.420
respectfully welcomes the Youhu Clan's immortal elder.

04:39.740 --> 04:41.300
It's the ninth day of the third month again.

04:40.260 --> 04:42.260
[Steward of the Youhu Clan, Sheng Xiang]

04:41.530 --> 04:42.770
The human race is here as usual

04:42.850 --> 04:45.020
to pay homage to the Youhu Clan immortals

04:45.260 --> 04:46.460
and present tributes.

04:46.690 --> 04:48.980
We present excellent young maidens from our clan

04:49.180 --> 04:51.010
to serve as maids in the immortal mountain.

04:51.420 --> 04:53.010
This mountain is called Fangwai,

04:53.090 --> 04:54.820
it has spirits because immortals reside here.

04:55.090 --> 04:56.090
It must not be desecrated.

04:57.659 --> 05:00.300
Shen Ying pays respects to the spirit of Fangwai Mountain.

05:09.070 --> 05:10.230
Why aren't you bowing?

05:10.570 --> 05:11.990
The mountain spirit doesn't need my worship.

05:11.650 --> 05:13.330
[Craftswoman of the Divine Race, Ji Tanyin]

05:18.730 --> 05:20.050
You can communicate with the mountain?

05:20.540 --> 05:21.290
Fangwai has a spirit

05:21.980 --> 05:23.300
that can understand the intentions of all living beings.

05:25.130 --> 05:26.420
What's your name?

05:26.970 --> 05:27.890
Ji Tanyin.

05:37.700 --> 05:38.850
The mountain path is foggy.

05:39.090 --> 05:40.450
Use my lamp

05:40.500 --> 05:41.780
to light your way.

05:42.490 --> 05:43.290
Thank you.

05:46.180 --> 05:48.690
This is a divine lantern. It will extinguish if it touches the ground.

05:48.770 --> 05:49.570
If the lamp goes out,

05:49.770 --> 05:51.260
you won't be able to enter the mountain.

06:18.130 --> 06:20.750
[High Priest, Yuanzhong]

06:19.780 --> 06:21.890
Earth is the mother of air.

06:22.130 --> 06:24.010
Where there is earth, there is air.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.700
Air is the mother of water.

06:25.700 --> 06:27.460
Where there is air, there is water.

06:27.610 --> 06:30.220
Therefore, what should be kept dry should be buried deep.

06:30.250 --> 06:32.810
While what is stored on flat and open ground should be buried shallow.

06:33.420 --> 06:36.180
The classics state that when earth flows, air flows,

06:36.360 --> 06:38.930
and thus things come to life.

06:41.900 --> 06:44.400
[Human Alchemist]

06:54.770 --> 06:56.940
Esteemed sir. you're sitting at the burial place

06:56.940 --> 06:58.260
I've chosen for my client.

06:58.580 --> 07:01.730
Could I trouble you to move a bit?

07:04.370 --> 07:05.770
Do you know where this is?

07:06.330 --> 07:07.130
Where?

07:07.210 --> 07:08.650
This is Fangwai Mountain.

07:09.820 --> 07:10.940
This... this...

07:13.580 --> 07:15.610
You dare to choose a burial place on Fangwai Mountain?

07:16.050 --> 07:17.740
How bold of you.

07:17.740 --> 07:18.980
This... this... I...

07:19.450 --> 07:20.740
I was clearly supposed to

07:20.740 --> 07:22.620
go to Qiguan Mountain!

07:22.900 --> 07:24.410
There was a storm, and then...

07:24.850 --> 07:27.170
How did I end up on Fangwai Mountain?

07:28.570 --> 07:29.860
Thank you for informing me, esteemed sir.

07:29.890 --> 07:30.890
May I ask if you are

07:30.930 --> 07:33.280
an immortal from this mountain?

07:33.940 --> 07:34.850
I suppose so.

07:36.320 --> 07:37.360
No wonder, no wonder.

07:37.420 --> 07:39.290
I see you have a noble countenance,

07:39.290 --> 07:41.500
destined for great wealth and honor.

07:41.500 --> 07:43.380
You will surely enjoy good health throughout your life,

07:43.380 --> 07:44.380
everything will go smoothly,

07:44.380 --> 07:45.500
your descendants will bring you joy,

07:45.500 --> 07:48.659
and you'll experience the greatest pleasures of the mortal world!

07:51.450 --> 07:52.250
Me?

07:52.500 --> 07:53.290
Yes, indeed.

07:53.420 --> 07:54.640
Good health?

07:54.890 --> 07:56.090
Everything goes smoothly?

07:56.090 --> 07:57.780
Yes, look.

07:57.820 --> 07:59.170
Li represents Fire and Zhen represents Mountain Lake.

07:59.170 --> 08:00.810
Fire above Heaven represents Great Possession, and Wind and Thunder represent Great Strength.

08:00.810 --> 08:02.180
It's a sign of rising.

08:02.420 --> 08:04.620
Good fortune, good fortune indeed!

08:04.680 --> 08:06.150
You will soon meet

08:06.180 --> 08:08.020
your destined benefactor.

08:08.050 --> 08:09.170
She comes from an extraordinary background

08:09.170 --> 08:10.220
and is immensely wealthy and noble.

08:10.220 --> 08:11.220
As long as you meet her,

08:11.220 --> 08:12.810
your life will be smooth sailing from then on.

08:12.810 --> 08:14.570
No more misfortunes will befall you.

08:18.260 --> 08:19.580
Good health.

08:19.580 --> 08:19.850
Yes.

08:19.850 --> 08:21.280
Everything goes smoothly.

08:21.410 --> 08:22.250
Indeed.

08:24.940 --> 08:26.810
I'm usually wrong nine times out of ten,

08:26.810 --> 08:28.650
but this is my last divination for today.

08:28.820 --> 08:30.970
Trust me, it will surely be accurate.

08:31.040 --> 08:34.320
Trust me, it will surely be accurate!

08:42.940 --> 08:44.169
Is the lantern heavy?

08:44.410 --> 08:45.690
Do you need help with it?

08:45.900 --> 08:46.690
No need.

08:53.700 --> 08:56.220
This is a divine lantern. It will extinguish if it touches the ground.

08:56.460 --> 08:57.240
If the light goes out,

08:57.290 --> 08:58.780
you won't be able to enter the mountain.

09:01.450 --> 09:03.010
It has a sinking stone on it.

09:32.900 --> 09:34.450
All these paths lead up the mountain anyway.

09:34.810 --> 09:36.210
Just pick any one.

09:36.650 --> 09:37.970
Why hesitate here?

09:58.770 --> 10:00.530
Are you an immortal residing on this mountain?

10:00.850 --> 10:01.650
Yes.

10:02.650 --> 10:03.580
Then why don't you

10:03.580 --> 10:04.460
just point out a path for me?

10:04.460 --> 10:05.900
Why make me choose for myself?

10:06.050 --> 10:07.370
I don't know your identity,

10:07.930 --> 10:09.660
nor do I know where you're heading.

10:10.130 --> 10:11.380
How can I guide you?

10:11.970 --> 10:13.090
I'm a human sent here

10:13.090 --> 10:14.140
as a maid candidate.

10:14.140 --> 10:15.220
I'm from Pingzhou,

10:15.220 --> 10:16.720
heading to the gate of Fangwai Mountain.

10:18.660 --> 10:19.980
A maid candidate?

10:20.740 --> 10:21.820
What's your name?

10:25.780 --> 10:27.220
Since I don't know your identity,

10:27.540 --> 10:28.540
how can I know

10:28.780 --> 10:30.620
if what you're saying is true or false?

10:30.860 --> 10:32.420
How can I easily let you up the mountain?

10:35.210 --> 10:36.530
That path is wrong.

10:38.460 --> 10:39.690
This one might not be right either.

10:43.210 --> 10:44.540
You're a human craftsman.

10:44.650 --> 10:45.700
What's it to you?

10:45.890 --> 10:46.890
Just curious.

10:47.260 --> 10:48.580
A craftsman's status is noble.

10:48.700 --> 10:49.720
How could you willingly

10:49.720 --> 10:51.540
come to Fangwai Mountain to be a maid?

10:52.680 --> 10:53.490
I've long admired

10:53.490 --> 10:54.740
the Youhu Clan's High Priest

10:54.740 --> 10:55.970
and am willing to serve him for life.

10:55.970 --> 10:56.820
Is that not allowed?

11:01.140 --> 11:02.170
What are you laughing at?

11:02.860 --> 11:03.690
Nothing.

11:07.940 --> 11:08.740
Come.

11:09.180 --> 11:10.290
I'll take you up the mountain.

11:26.250 --> 11:27.250
The fog is thick in the mountains.

11:27.570 --> 11:28.620
Watch your step.

11:37.250 --> 11:38.050
Alright.

11:38.340 --> 11:39.370
We're almost there.

11:42.010 --> 11:42.820
Thanks.

11:43.330 --> 11:44.850
You still haven't told me your name.

11:44.850 --> 11:46.490
You haven't told me your name either.

11:46.490 --> 11:47.690
But I helped you.

11:47.900 --> 11:49.690
That's not a grateful attitude.

11:54.620 --> 11:55.550
What's this?

11:55.580 --> 11:57.090
It's a lucky egg. I made it.

11:57.090 --> 11:58.410
It can bring you good luck.

11:58.810 --> 11:59.900
How magical.

12:03.820 --> 12:05.180
You're going to serve the High Priest?

12:05.410 --> 12:06.180
He's not exactly

12:06.180 --> 12:07.140
an easy person to get along with.

12:21.460 --> 12:24.370
Peace, joy, and prosperity to you.

12:32.540 --> 12:33.690
It's time.

12:34.050 --> 12:35.100
Everyone, please enter.

12:36.040 --> 12:37.030
Immortal Elder, please wait.

12:38.330 --> 12:40.180
Could you make an exception?

12:40.490 --> 12:42.170
There's still one person who hasn't...

12:42.200 --> 12:43.010
She's here!

12:48.620 --> 12:49.460
I'm returning this to you.

12:49.570 --> 12:50.940
Thank you, Immortal Elder, for bestowing the lantern.

12:55.170 --> 12:56.420
Not bad.

12:56.780 --> 12:57.570
Let's go.

13:05.240 --> 13:07.700
[Youhu]

13:06.480 --> 13:08.280
There are many barrier formations within our clan.

13:08.860 --> 13:11.100
Some of which are used for powerful attacks and defeating enemies.

13:11.300 --> 13:13.420
Without guidance, do not wander aimlessly.

13:13.530 --> 13:14.850
Lest you lose your life.

13:16.530 --> 13:18.220
Thank you for your advice, Immortal Elder.

13:20.740 --> 13:21.930
The Fangwai Immortal Mountain

13:22.000 --> 13:24.130
has a total of nine towering peaks

13:24.210 --> 13:25.770
and three hundred other famous mountains.

13:26.140 --> 13:28.410
Most residents are elders of our clan.

13:29.490 --> 13:30.690
That is Tianqu Peak,

13:30.980 --> 13:33.130
the residence of our clan's Elder Dingxu.

13:33.500 --> 13:35.890
Elder Dingxu is our clan leader.

13:36.180 --> 13:37.940
Though he is compassionate and kind,

13:38.020 --> 13:40.780
Tianqu Peak is still a forbidden area.

13:40.810 --> 13:43.280
I will keep all this in mind.

13:43.810 --> 13:45.180
That Jinxia Palace

13:45.330 --> 13:47.180
is the residence of Young Master Tanghua.

13:47.740 --> 13:48.730
Young Master Tanghua

13:48.730 --> 13:50.460
is the commander of our clan's war department.

13:50.610 --> 13:52.100
He often interacts with various clans.

13:52.490 --> 13:53.490
Past here,

13:53.930 --> 13:55.740
ahead is Xiaoxiang Peak.

13:56.740 --> 13:58.330
You need to enter Xiaoxiang Peak first

13:58.330 --> 13:59.450
to study your lessons.

13:59.700 --> 14:00.900
After your study period is over,

14:00.900 --> 14:03.330
the masters from each mountain will come to select attendants.

14:04.170 --> 14:05.300
Immortal Elder, if I may,

14:05.610 --> 14:07.660
what about that peak so high you can't

14:06.680 --> 14:08.270
[Human, Lyu Yao]

14:08.000 --> 14:09.060
even see it?

14:09.500 --> 14:10.890
That's the Yuquan Peak,

14:11.650 --> 14:13.380
the residence of the High Priest.

14:20.540 --> 14:23.090
[Yuquan Peak, Liujiao Palace]

14:32.640 --> 14:34.690
[Youhu Clan, Xiaoxiang Peak]

14:45.010 --> 14:46.610
Greetings, Steward Sheng Xiang.

14:45.320 --> 14:47.800
[Human, instructor of Fangwai Mountain, Zhi Dai]

14:48.900 --> 14:50.540
I'll leave them in your care now.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.100
Rest assured,

14:52.300 --> 14:54.380
I will teach them well.

15:01.020 --> 15:03.050
I am Zhi Dai, an instructor at Xiaoxiang Peak.

15:03.370 --> 15:05.180
I'm responsible for your upcoming lessons.

15:05.490 --> 15:06.940
I oversee all matters

15:07.330 --> 15:09.460
and determine whether you stay or leave.

15:10.260 --> 15:12.170
Steward Shen Ying, who brought us here,

15:12.400 --> 15:13.480
just left like that?

15:13.720 --> 15:14.890
Did I permit you to speak?

15:17.570 --> 15:18.420
I know

15:18.770 --> 15:20.970
most of you come from noble backgrounds

15:21.140 --> 15:22.260
and have extraordinary origins.

15:23.100 --> 15:24.100
But all of that

15:24.340 --> 15:25.860
is of no use here.

15:26.300 --> 15:28.210
You're here to be servants,

15:28.290 --> 15:30.160
to serve others as subordinates.

15:30.850 --> 15:31.940
Remember this.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.860
Know your place.

15:35.570 --> 15:36.340
As for the rules,

15:36.340 --> 15:38.370
I will teach you one by one in the future.

15:38.690 --> 15:40.300
Now, five people to a room.

15:40.300 --> 15:41.450
Choose for yourselves.

15:43.090 --> 15:44.170
This bell is the signal.

15:44.410 --> 15:45.660
When the bell rings, assemble.

15:46.810 --> 15:49.220
Peace, joy, and prosperity to you.

15:49.220 --> 15:51.820
Peace, joy, and prosperity to you.

15:51.850 --> 15:54.570
Peace, joy, and prosperity to you.

15:57.610 --> 15:59.490
Have you taken care of everything I asked?

16:01.580 --> 16:03.050
[Weapon spirit, Zi Fei]

16:02.090 --> 16:03.650
You can rest assured when I'm in charge.

16:04.730 --> 16:05.570
Take your medicine.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.240
I won't.

16:09.930 --> 16:12.220
Fine, don't take it. The sooner you die, the sooner you'll be free.

16:12.220 --> 16:14.060
Then I can find a new master.

16:15.970 --> 16:16.820
You won't drink it?

16:17.020 --> 16:17.900
Fine, I'll pour it out.

16:17.900 --> 16:19.260
You are my weapon spirit.

16:19.260 --> 16:21.170
If I die, you won't survive either.

16:21.500 --> 16:22.830
Find a new master?

16:24.150 --> 16:25.240
Keep dreaming.

16:31.730 --> 16:32.570
Where did you get this?

16:34.330 --> 16:35.370
Someone gave it to me.

16:35.610 --> 16:36.420
Who?

16:36.690 --> 16:38.260
There's someone on this mountain giving you gifts?

16:40.260 --> 16:41.060
I don't know.

16:41.200 --> 16:43.370
I only know it was a human woman,

16:43.550 --> 16:44.430
from Pingzhou.

16:44.820 --> 16:46.250
You went down the mountain without permission today.

16:46.300 --> 16:48.170
Dingxu would be furious if he knew.

16:50.820 --> 16:53.020
What else is there on this mountain

16:53.020 --> 16:54.610
that he doesn't know about?

16:57.980 --> 16:59.010
Go and find me

16:59.010 --> 17:00.770
this batch of human maids' roster.

17:01.180 --> 17:02.290
What do you want that for?

17:02.930 --> 17:04.930
I'm bored. Just passing time

17:05.290 --> 17:07.810
and doing what a useless person should do.

17:34.810 --> 17:35.890
Madam Zhi Dai

17:35.890 --> 17:37.700
seems difficult to get along with.

17:38.090 --> 17:39.780
Well, that's what instructors are like.

17:39.900 --> 17:40.730
We came here

17:40.730 --> 17:42.370
just to take orders.

17:42.860 --> 17:44.010
Have you thought about

17:44.010 --> 17:45.770
which immortal elder you want to serve?

17:46.180 --> 17:47.890
I heard that Young Master Tanghua

17:47.890 --> 17:49.050
is proficient in immortal arts

17:49.140 --> 17:50.900
and is also very kind to humans.

17:51.100 --> 17:52.780
The immortal elders on each peak have different personalities,

17:52.780 --> 17:53.740
different preferences,

17:53.740 --> 17:54.760
and their cultivation styles

17:54.760 --> 17:55.890
are also different.

17:56.060 --> 17:57.650
As long as we cater to their preferences,

17:57.650 --> 17:58.530
our chances of staying

17:58.530 --> 17:59.530
are still very high.

17:59.530 --> 17:59.850
are still very high.

18:01.530 --> 18:03.340
Lyu Yao, what about you?

18:04.570 --> 18:06.100
I haven't decided yet.

18:09.210 --> 18:10.000
Do you know anything about

18:10.000 --> 18:11.500
the High Priest of Youhu Clan?

18:12.020 --> 18:13.610
You want to serve the High Priest?

18:14.050 --> 18:15.730
Yuquan Peak is the hardest to get into.

18:15.730 --> 18:16.690
I heard it's been many years

18:16.690 --> 18:18.100
since they've chosen any maids to enter the palace.

18:18.180 --> 18:19.100
Why is that?

18:21.110 --> 18:21.770
Well,

18:21.770 --> 18:23.580
do you know what he likes?

18:23.730 --> 18:25.340
They say the High Priest of Youhu Clan

18:25.340 --> 18:27.300
is the last god in this world.

18:27.300 --> 18:28.180
The thoughts of a god,

18:28.180 --> 18:29.690
how can mortals possibly understand?

18:29.690 --> 18:31.010
If I had to guess,

18:31.770 --> 18:33.460
I'd say the High Priest

18:33.900 --> 18:35.380
probably likes killing people.

18:36.100 --> 18:37.100
Killing people?

18:37.140 --> 18:37.980
In the Battle of Pinghu,

18:37.980 --> 18:40.010
blood flowed like the sea, and corpses piled up like mountains.

18:40.010 --> 18:41.740
It wasn't just the War Demons who died.

18:44.820 --> 18:46.260
Madam Zhi Dai said to follow the bell's command.

18:46.260 --> 18:47.580
Let's hurry over there.

18:55.580 --> 18:56.970
These are for you.

18:57.260 --> 18:58.660
One for each of you.

18:58.660 --> 18:59.810
Wear it on your left wrist.

19:11.250 --> 19:12.370
Why aren't you wearing it?

19:13.900 --> 19:15.620
This seems to be a magical device.

19:16.130 --> 19:17.050
I'm asking you.

19:17.450 --> 19:18.730
Why aren't you wearing it?

19:19.700 --> 19:21.480
This is a device that restrains people.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.400
Ji Tanyin.

19:28.300 --> 19:29.890
She seems to be a craftsman.

19:31.130 --> 19:33.250
They say human craftsmen are highly skilled.

19:34.610 --> 19:35.980
Do you think she can

19:35.980 --> 19:37.300
take this off?

19:38.890 --> 19:39.860
Why aren't the people from Tianqu Peak

19:39.860 --> 19:41.210
here yet?

19:41.770 --> 19:43.700
Sheng Xiang, the steward of Tianqu Peak,

19:43.850 --> 19:45.370
pays respects to the High Priest.

19:51.210 --> 19:52.180
What did you say?

19:52.450 --> 19:53.700
Look at this bracelet.

19:53.820 --> 19:55.220
It's made of immortal gold,

19:55.340 --> 19:56.410
naturally formless

19:56.410 --> 19:57.540
and not limited in shape.

19:57.930 --> 19:58.900
It can be big or small.

19:58.900 --> 20:00.060
It can open and close at will.

20:00.860 --> 20:02.770
It has yin-yang fish patterns on it,

20:03.450 --> 20:05.500
paired with a Taiji diagram.

20:05.700 --> 20:06.970
It has features

20:07.140 --> 20:08.290
both visible and hidden.

20:09.810 --> 20:10.690
This is clearly a

20:10.690 --> 20:12.010
device for restraining people.

20:12.890 --> 20:14.760
Although the craftsmanship is a bit rough,

20:14.820 --> 20:16.170
and the technique is not sophisticated,

20:16.820 --> 20:18.600
it's similar in principle to Xuantan Zhenjun's dragon-binding rope

20:18.600 --> 20:20.340
and the Immortal Granny's jade fire tongs.

20:20.490 --> 20:22.100
They share the same effect through different means.

20:23.060 --> 20:24.620
This Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelet

20:24.650 --> 20:26.180
is a divine treasure.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.780
Every human entering the mountain receives one.

20:29.020 --> 20:30.660
It's used to restrict their movements

20:30.900 --> 20:32.170
and confine their whereabouts.

20:34.060 --> 20:35.330
Confine our whereabouts?

20:36.380 --> 20:38.180
You don't need to feel dissatisfied

20:38.580 --> 20:39.970
or think that wearing this

20:39.970 --> 20:41.380
forfeits your freedom and traps you

20:41.380 --> 20:42.410
like a bird in a cage.

20:43.170 --> 20:45.180
Fangwai Mountain is the dwelling place of immortals.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.420
There are many forbidden areas in the mountain

20:47.420 --> 20:48.130
that cannot be entered.

20:48.420 --> 20:50.260
And the immortal elders in the mountain

20:50.290 --> 20:51.410
have capricious personalities.

20:52.020 --> 20:53.850
They don't have time to watch over you all day.

20:56.180 --> 20:57.500
With this Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelet,

20:57.500 --> 20:58.420
you'll know

20:58.420 --> 21:00.370
where you can and cannot go.

21:00.650 --> 21:02.260
You can avoid making mistakes

21:02.260 --> 21:03.170
and harming yourselves.

21:04.820 --> 21:06.640
So if we accidentally take the wrong path

21:06.730 --> 21:07.860
and enter a forbidden area,

21:08.010 --> 21:09.100
how will this bracelet

21:09.130 --> 21:10.610
remind us?

21:13.600 --> 21:15.040
Try it and you'll find out.

21:15.450 --> 21:17.130
Fangwai Mountain never lacks people.

21:17.350 --> 21:18.710
If you don't want to stay here,

21:18.780 --> 21:19.810
leave early.

21:23.090 --> 21:24.020
High Priest.

21:24.730 --> 21:25.820
Speak your mind.

21:26.530 --> 21:28.580
I mainly want to report to you about

21:28.580 --> 21:31.420
the human maids coming up the mountain for selection.

21:32.090 --> 21:33.260
That's your business.

21:33.570 --> 21:35.290
Thank you for your trust, High Priest.

21:35.450 --> 21:36.380
Is there anything else?

21:36.500 --> 21:37.610
Then that's all.

21:38.410 --> 21:39.250
You may leave then.

21:39.400 --> 21:40.140
Yes.

21:47.100 --> 21:48.350
Oh, look at my memory.

21:48.460 --> 21:50.170
I almost forgot one thing.

21:52.450 --> 21:53.420
Just now, Elder Dingxu

21:53.420 --> 21:54.570
asked me to inquire

21:54.980 --> 21:56.940
if you went down the mountain today.

21:58.940 --> 22:00.090
And what for?

22:00.460 --> 22:01.250
To fish.

22:01.660 --> 22:02.460
To fish?

22:02.930 --> 22:03.740
That's right.

22:03.930 --> 22:04.930
They're kept in the back kitchen.

22:04.980 --> 22:06.010
Do you want to go see?

22:06.010 --> 22:06.810
No need.

22:06.940 --> 22:09.450
You must be in a good mood.

22:10.380 --> 22:11.820
I've finished my studies for today.

22:11.940 --> 22:12.970
I was bored

22:13.140 --> 22:14.140
and decided to stroll about.

22:14.390 --> 22:16.150
Is there a problem?

22:16.480 --> 22:17.400
Of course not.

22:17.740 --> 22:19.530
High Priest, you are a demigod.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.650
You're highly noble.

22:20.730 --> 22:21.700
All things in the world

22:21.700 --> 22:23.580
exist to serve you.

22:23.780 --> 22:25.020
Naturally, you can go

22:25.020 --> 22:26.050
wherever you wish.

22:26.130 --> 22:28.620
It's just that Elder Dingxu said

22:28.860 --> 22:30.450
your health is poor

22:30.450 --> 22:31.970
and you're carrying a divine artifact.

22:32.180 --> 22:33.700
You shouldn't wander too far.

22:34.780 --> 22:35.580
Also,

22:35.930 --> 22:37.460
Elder Dingxu also said,

22:37.780 --> 22:39.540
to better assist you

22:39.540 --> 22:40.660
guard the void, gather energy,

22:40.660 --> 22:41.890
and communicate with heaven and earth,

22:42.000 --> 22:43.140
the previously once-in-ten-days

22:43.140 --> 22:44.410
spirit refinement at Tianqu Peak

22:44.730 --> 22:46.380
has been changed to once every five days.

22:46.600 --> 22:48.170
Please remember

22:48.340 --> 22:49.450
and do not delay.

22:49.750 --> 22:52.190
I will now take my leave.

22:57.220 --> 22:58.370
They're so obedient,

22:58.610 --> 23:00.010
exactly as you thought.

23:34.170 --> 23:36.050
He has perfectly merged with the Divine Hand.

23:36.490 --> 23:38.300
Given his mortal constitution,

23:38.690 --> 23:40.700
taking the hand means killing him.

23:41.700 --> 23:42.940
But I can't be soft-hearted.

23:43.360 --> 23:44.120
Hannyu said

23:44.140 --> 23:45.620
he's a brutal and violent man.

23:45.980 --> 23:47.420
With the Divine Hand in his possession,

23:47.660 --> 23:48.860
it will only bring

23:48.860 --> 23:50.380
greater disaster to the world.

23:55.080 --> 23:57.690
Peace, joy, and prosperity to all.

23:57.780 --> 23:59.130
Peace, joy...

24:09.370 --> 24:11.180
Three or five gathered, the sun and moon together.

24:11.500 --> 24:13.260
Emerging from brightness, entering into darkness.

24:13.430 --> 24:15.470
Evil spirits dare not face the righteous qi.

24:15.500 --> 24:17.380
Three souls bind to grass, six spirits enter the body.

24:17.380 --> 24:18.930
Evil gods shall be vanquished, destroyed!

24:30.090 --> 24:31.650
[Lecture Hall]

24:32.810 --> 24:34.980
If you wish to remain by the immortal elders' side,

24:35.290 --> 24:36.610
you must follow their orders,

24:36.700 --> 24:38.650
perform their tasks, and record their affairs.

24:39.210 --> 24:41.580
To attend to the immortal elders' daily needs,

24:42.060 --> 24:43.660
being able to write well

24:44.250 --> 24:45.690
is particularly important.

24:46.310 --> 24:47.150
Let's begin.

24:58.090 --> 24:59.620
It's said that the High Priest of Youhu Clan

24:59.650 --> 25:01.820
changes his words daily and his moods unpredictably.

25:02.260 --> 25:03.410
If someone violates

25:03.410 --> 25:04.460
his taboos,

25:04.810 --> 25:06.050
he kills without hesitation.

25:06.660 --> 25:07.690
When you enter the hall later,

25:07.880 --> 25:09.280
you must all remain silent.

25:09.300 --> 25:10.090
Yes.

25:12.460 --> 25:13.380
Steward Sheng Xiang said

25:13.380 --> 25:14.260
the High Priest drinks

25:14.260 --> 25:14.930
one hundred jars of wine every night.

25:14.930 --> 25:16.340
This wine is for the High Priest.

25:16.340 --> 25:17.930
If we don't deliver it soon, our lives may be at stake.

25:17.980 --> 25:19.010
Hurry, hurry!

25:19.940 --> 25:20.970
May the gods bless me

25:21.060 --> 25:22.530
to be selected by the Jinxia Palace.

25:22.720 --> 25:24.050
I really don't want to die.

25:24.170 --> 25:26.020
The High Priest of Liujiao Palace is brutal and violent.

25:26.020 --> 25:27.100
He likes to eat human necks

25:27.140 --> 25:28.810
and favors young, beautiful women.

25:28.930 --> 25:30.450
I really, really don't want to die.

25:31.420 --> 25:34.450
With just one palm strike from the High Priest,

25:34.450 --> 25:37.930
the entire Pinghu Xianzhou instantly collapsed.

25:39.750 --> 25:42.030
The birds and beasts in the vicinity

25:42.060 --> 25:43.570
all turned to dust.

25:43.740 --> 25:46.260
Not a single member of the War Demon clan survived.

25:46.580 --> 25:48.140
The chieftain of the War Demon clan

25:48.220 --> 25:50.420
clung to his last breath, refusing to die.

25:50.460 --> 25:52.450
High Priest stepped forward,

25:52.660 --> 25:55.010
grabbed the opponent's head,

25:55.380 --> 25:58.490
and bit down with his mouth.

26:03.050 --> 26:04.250
I told you to practice calligraphy.

26:04.420 --> 26:05.450
What are you doing?

26:14.300 --> 26:15.100
Tanyin.

26:15.860 --> 26:16.690
Tanyin.

26:17.510 --> 26:18.300
Mr. Loong.

26:20.320 --> 26:21.120
Tanyin.

26:21.630 --> 26:23.510
Have you seen the young lad from the

26:23.030 --> 26:25.230
[Master Yi of the Divine Race, Mr. Loong]

26:23.550 --> 26:25.100
Youhu Clan with the Divine Hand?

26:25.300 --> 26:26.130
I have.

26:26.250 --> 26:27.060
How was it?

26:27.330 --> 26:28.890
Just as Hannv said,

26:29.010 --> 26:30.250
he's a brutal person.

26:30.410 --> 26:31.700
He's killed countless people outside

26:31.800 --> 26:33.080
and enslaved his own clan internally.

26:33.140 --> 26:34.460
He deserves to die.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.790
Then I'm relieved.

26:36.810 --> 26:39.620
I was worried you might become softhearted.

26:40.000 --> 26:41.050
Don't worry, Mr. Loong.

26:41.050 --> 26:42.120
That won't happen.

26:43.490 --> 26:45.570
So when do you plan to make your move?

26:47.920 --> 26:49.410
Tomorrow is the 19th of March.

26:49.450 --> 26:50.410
The mysterious gives birth to all things,

26:50.410 --> 26:51.440
nine times nine returns to one.

26:51.490 --> 26:52.850
The Way of Heaven is governed by nine.

26:52.930 --> 26:54.320
I like this number.

26:54.610 --> 26:56.720
The opponent is the host of the Divine Hand.

26:56.720 --> 26:58.530
I'm afraid he won't be easy to deal with.

26:58.650 --> 27:00.010
In the mortal realm, do not

27:00.010 --> 27:01.880
overuse your magical powers.

27:01.880 --> 27:04.080
At best, it will damage your source of magic,

27:04.170 --> 27:05.490
causing your qi and blood to churn.

27:05.690 --> 27:07.450
At worst, it will severely injure your spirit,

27:07.450 --> 27:08.770
destroying all your cultivation.

27:08.770 --> 27:10.360
You must remember this well.

27:11.210 --> 27:12.090
Don't worry.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.410
I have craftsmanship skills to rely on,

27:13.530 --> 27:14.760
and I know some martial arts techniques.

27:14.870 --> 27:16.490
I don't need to rely on divine power for everything.

27:16.880 --> 27:19.200
Besides, I created the Divine Hand.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.450
I know what to do.

27:21.600 --> 27:22.410
Oh, right.

27:22.480 --> 27:24.440
You mentioned earlier that you wanted to go to Fangwai Mountain

27:24.440 --> 27:25.530
to find a young man.

27:25.730 --> 27:27.320
He's one of your followers.

27:27.320 --> 27:28.440
Did you find him?

28:11.840 --> 28:13.320
When he saved me back then,

28:13.610 --> 28:15.080
he was still a spirit fox.

28:15.460 --> 28:17.800
That half of the jade token was also taken by him.

28:21.480 --> 28:22.170
Now,

28:22.630 --> 28:23.870
I don't know where he is.

28:29.570 --> 28:30.650
Time has passed,

28:30.850 --> 28:32.010
and he has already grown up.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.680
His appearance has also changed.

28:33.800 --> 28:35.760
It shouldn't be that easy to find him.

28:36.080 --> 28:37.810
You are the God of Craftsmanship,

28:37.810 --> 28:38.760
with countless followers.

28:38.760 --> 28:39.960
Why do you insist on finding

28:39.960 --> 28:40.960
this particular one?

28:41.770 --> 28:42.720
He's different.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.360
But please rest assured, Mr. Loong,

28:46.290 --> 28:47.700
I won't neglect my duties for personal reasons.

28:54.480 --> 28:55.450
Madam Zhi Dai.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.000
You've been away from home for 40 years.

28:59.000 --> 28:59.810
Don't you miss

28:59.810 --> 29:01.080
your family?

29:01.330 --> 29:02.960
Your father is nearly 90 years old.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.480
Living to 70 has been rare since ancient times.

29:04.510 --> 29:07.150
Think about it, how much time does he have left?

29:10.610 --> 29:11.400
Young Mistress Dai,

29:11.760 --> 29:13.080
may I have a word with you in private?

29:15.970 --> 29:16.890
My father,

29:17.130 --> 29:18.180
how is he?

29:19.320 --> 29:20.680
The City Lord has grown old.

29:21.000 --> 29:23.280
These past two years, he's been very ill.

29:23.570 --> 29:24.640
When I left,

29:25.040 --> 29:26.450
he was already bedridden.

29:27.090 --> 29:29.690
That's why I took the liberty

29:29.990 --> 29:31.190
to come see you without permission.

29:33.730 --> 29:35.810
But seeing you today,

29:37.160 --> 29:38.890
you're no different from those

29:38.890 --> 29:40.730
maids of our clan who are dogmatically controlled

29:41.080 --> 29:42.550
by the Youhu Clan.

29:44.040 --> 29:45.110
What are you trying to say?

29:48.650 --> 29:49.670
Pardon me.

29:49.710 --> 29:51.230
I humbly request you to descend the mountain

29:51.250 --> 29:52.370
and return to Yandu,

29:52.850 --> 29:54.370
to offer your method of reversing aging

29:54.400 --> 29:55.920
and maintaining eternal youth

29:56.250 --> 29:57.320
to the old City Lord.

29:57.450 --> 30:00.130
This way, we can safeguard our human race's future.

30:08.750 --> 30:10.710
Tanyin, here you are.

30:11.570 --> 30:12.570
Have you eaten?

30:12.570 --> 30:13.330
Are you hungry?

30:13.770 --> 30:14.920
We brought some snacks back.

30:14.920 --> 30:15.920
Try one quickly.

30:16.490 --> 30:17.610
You're so kind.

30:17.810 --> 30:18.960
She has gotten on

30:18.960 --> 30:20.280
Madam Zhi Dai's good side.

30:20.280 --> 30:21.160
Instead of practicing,

30:21.160 --> 30:22.280
she can hide here and slack off.

30:22.280 --> 30:23.160
How could she be hungry?

30:24.680 --> 30:25.480
Quick, have a taste.

30:29.490 --> 30:30.370
Is it good?

30:31.640 --> 30:32.810
I made these.

30:32.960 --> 30:33.890
We were in the kitchen this afternoon,

30:33.890 --> 30:34.950
practicing our culinary skills.

30:35.040 --> 30:36.850
The ingredients in the kitchen are all excellent.

30:36.850 --> 30:37.800
So the taste of what we make

30:37.800 --> 30:38.970
naturally can't be bad.

30:39.240 --> 30:40.200
Have some more.

30:40.530 --> 30:41.310
Thank you.

30:43.490 --> 30:44.490
Do you know?

30:44.690 --> 30:46.600
Today is the White Robe Festival of the Youhu Clan.

30:46.890 --> 30:47.850
White Robe Festival?

30:47.970 --> 30:48.970
What kind of festival is that?

30:49.560 --> 30:51.830
It's when the Youhu Clan pays tribute to ghosts and gods

30:51.870 --> 30:53.360
and worships their ancestors.

30:53.440 --> 30:54.960
The Youhu Clan are already divine beings themselves.

30:54.960 --> 30:56.130
Do they still need to worship ghosts and gods?

30:56.450 --> 30:58.410
How can they be considered divine beings?

30:58.440 --> 31:00.360
The Youhu Clan is just like us humans.

31:00.410 --> 31:01.800
We're all mortal beings.

31:03.810 --> 31:04.690
Tell me,

31:04.720 --> 31:07.250
are there really ghosts and monsters in this world?

31:07.250 --> 31:08.160
Of course there are.

31:08.160 --> 31:09.280
I've even seen one.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.600
I was still young at that time.

31:10.600 --> 31:11.480
I remember one year,

31:11.480 --> 31:12.360
during the Zhongyuan Festival,

31:12.360 --> 31:13.640
my parents took me out.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.970
We accidentally got separated.

31:15.370 --> 31:16.880
I was crying and searching.

31:17.080 --> 31:18.690
Somehow I ended up by the lake.

31:19.010 --> 31:20.280
I squatted by the lake and called out,

31:20.480 --> 31:21.850
"Father, Mother!"

31:22.290 --> 31:24.000
Suddenly I heard my mother respond.

31:24.290 --> 31:25.880
I looked towards the sound.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.370
There was a big mass of hair in the lake

31:28.810 --> 31:30.400
and a pale white face.

31:31.080 --> 31:31.840
That face looked like

31:31.840 --> 31:33.530
it had been sewn with a sewing needle.

31:34.010 --> 31:35.440
It was full of cracks.

31:36.060 --> 31:36.850
And just like that,

31:37.240 --> 31:38.490
it was waving at me

31:38.810 --> 31:40.050
and calling my name.

31:40.760 --> 31:41.690
Then what?

31:42.210 --> 31:43.530
Then I ran away, of course!

31:43.530 --> 31:44.160
Later, I heard

31:44.160 --> 31:45.330
from an elderly neighbor

31:45.330 --> 31:47.000
that I had encountered a tailor ghost.

31:47.170 --> 31:48.080
A tailor ghost?

31:48.490 --> 31:50.170
It's a type of water ghost.

31:50.570 --> 31:51.490
They accidentally

31:51.490 --> 31:52.450
drowned in the water

31:52.480 --> 31:54.010
and their bodies were eaten by fish and shrimp.

31:54.210 --> 31:55.280
With no remains,

31:55.560 --> 31:56.770
they cannot reincarnate.

31:57.120 --> 31:58.290
To find release,

31:58.320 --> 31:59.680
they lure passersby into the water

31:59.930 --> 32:00.760
to take

32:00.760 --> 32:02.320
organs similar to their own

32:02.440 --> 32:04.160
and sew a new body.

32:10.050 --> 32:11.450
Stop talking about this.

32:11.810 --> 32:13.440
You're scaring Tanyin.

32:13.440 --> 32:14.280
I'm not afraid.

32:16.890 --> 32:18.160
Madam Zhi Dai is asking someone

32:18.160 --> 32:20.040
to bring tea and snacks to Steward Sheng Xiang.

32:20.040 --> 32:21.170
Who wants to go?

32:24.610 --> 32:25.640
No one? Fine.

32:25.640 --> 32:26.840
Then I'll go myself.

32:28.400 --> 32:29.210
That tailor ghost...

32:29.210 --> 32:29.970
Wait a moment.

32:31.290 --> 32:32.090
I'll go.

32:32.800 --> 32:34.530
Today is the White Robe Festival of the Youhu Clan.

32:34.640 --> 32:35.560
It's similar to our human's

32:35.560 --> 32:36.570
Ghost Festival.

32:36.570 --> 32:38.330
But I saw a large mass of hair in the water.

32:38.330 --> 32:40.040
There was a pale face within the hair,

32:40.040 --> 32:41.160
covered in cracks,

32:41.160 --> 32:41.970
as if it had been

32:41.970 --> 32:43.000
sewn together with a needle.

32:55.650 --> 32:56.450
Oh, it's you.

33:00.520 --> 33:01.330
I

33:02.040 --> 33:03.600
didn't plan to see you today.

33:03.920 --> 33:04.720
What a coincidence.

33:05.030 --> 33:06.630
I didn't come to see you on purpose either.

33:22.050 --> 33:23.570
Aren't you human maids

33:23.570 --> 33:25.040
supposed to be living on Xiaoxiang Peak?

33:25.280 --> 33:26.330
Why are you following me?

33:27.040 --> 33:27.920
It's along the way.

33:28.450 --> 33:29.530
You say that, but do you know

33:29.530 --> 33:30.360
where I'm going?

33:30.640 --> 33:32.200
It's in the same direction anyway.

34:05.550 --> 34:06.930
Are you afraid of walking at night?

34:09.159 --> 34:10.159
Of course not.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.360
Then you're afraid of ghosts?

34:12.239 --> 34:14.000
There are no ghosts in this world.

34:15.679 --> 34:16.760
If there are gods in this world,

34:17.250 --> 34:18.489
how can there be no ghosts?

34:19.320 --> 34:21.120
That's because after the war between gods and demons,

34:21.250 --> 34:22.239
Deity Taihe

34:22.270 --> 34:23.750
suppressed the demon clan with primordial power.

34:23.850 --> 34:24.920
The Demon Lord is dead.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.290
All evil and darkness in this world

34:26.290 --> 34:27.370
have been dispersed.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.250
What day is it today?

34:34.449 --> 34:35.280
The White Robe Festival.

34:38.199 --> 34:40.730
We of the Youhu Clan have no cemeteries.

34:40.929 --> 34:42.960
After death, we are refined into ashes

34:43.370 --> 34:44.570
and scattered under peach trees,

34:44.840 --> 34:45.889
becoming spring soil

34:46.159 --> 34:47.239
to nourish the peach wood.

34:47.530 --> 34:48.560
So we believe

34:48.560 --> 34:49.800
that every peach blossom

34:50.150 --> 34:51.949
is another continuation of life.

34:53.320 --> 34:54.480
Every peach blossom

34:55.250 --> 34:57.130
is also our blood relative.

35:01.760 --> 35:03.080
I came to pay respects to my ancestors.

35:03.560 --> 35:04.640
What are you here for?

35:09.330 --> 35:10.360
And you say you're not afraid.

35:11.610 --> 35:12.440
You don't understand.

35:12.850 --> 35:14.000
I'm not afraid,

35:15.570 --> 35:17.340
I just don't like this atmosphere.

35:20.490 --> 35:21.490
Still not afraid?

35:43.470 --> 35:45.070
What are you looking for?

35:45.090 --> 35:46.380
Search thoroughly for me.

35:46.410 --> 35:47.070
Yes.

36:00.200 --> 36:01.280
The patrol discovered

36:01.400 --> 36:03.600
someone performing curse rituals on the back mountain.

36:03.690 --> 36:04.390
They were said to be wearing

36:04.390 --> 36:06.240
the attire of our Xiaoxiang Peak maids.

36:06.650 --> 36:08.480
Today, we'll take a good look

36:08.730 --> 36:10.850
at who harbors evil intentions

36:11.000 --> 36:12.200
and seeks their own demise.

36:12.540 --> 36:13.340
Search carefully.

36:13.370 --> 36:14.020
Yes.

36:47.530 --> 36:49.450
Madam, we haven't found anything.

37:13.240 --> 37:14.040
Tanyin.

37:16.040 --> 37:17.850
Tanyin, are you asleep?

37:18.240 --> 37:19.600
I have something to ask you.

37:39.360 --> 37:40.730
Tanyin, did you take

37:40.730 --> 37:42.170
my things?

37:42.760 --> 37:43.800
What things?

37:44.320 --> 37:45.600
My luggage.

37:46.160 --> 37:47.160
I didn't take it.

37:47.240 --> 37:47.970
Is there anything

37:47.970 --> 37:49.450
important in your luggage?

37:49.770 --> 37:50.560
If there is,

37:50.560 --> 37:52.050
you can report to the instructor

37:52.270 --> 37:53.520
and ask her to help you find it.

38:01.810 --> 38:04.080
[Liujiao Palace]

38:05.910 --> 38:06.830
General Chiyi!

38:18.390 --> 38:19.180
Catch him!

38:19.220 --> 38:19.940
Commander...

38:20.210 --> 38:21.280
General Chiyi was poisoned.

38:21.310 --> 38:22.150
Go report this immediately!

38:22.190 --> 38:22.920
Anyone who runs into him

38:22.920 --> 38:23.800
should first protect themselves.

38:23.800 --> 38:25.250
Then try to capture him if possible!

38:25.290 --> 38:25.940
Understood!

38:28.550 --> 38:29.360
What's wrong?

38:30.410 --> 38:31.340
Something happened.

38:42.000 --> 38:42.800
Chiyi?

38:43.250 --> 38:44.330
He's not Chiyi!

38:44.590 --> 38:45.660
What do you mean

38:45.690 --> 38:46.450
he's not Chiyi?

38:46.530 --> 38:47.800
He wreaked havoc in the Jinxia Palace

38:47.840 --> 38:49.040
and injured many of our people

38:49.120 --> 38:50.400
as if he were controlled by someone.

38:54.370 --> 38:55.280
Hey, bastard,

38:55.970 --> 38:57.690
we meet again.

38:58.640 --> 38:59.960
What tricks are you playing?

39:00.350 --> 39:01.200
Too bad

39:01.660 --> 39:03.150
that I missed my strike.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.480
So

39:06.290 --> 39:08.090
I still can't kill you today.

39:09.290 --> 39:11.010
I'm here to annihilate you,

39:11.680 --> 39:13.520
every last one of you!

39:18.480 --> 39:19.480
Just you wait.

39:19.970 --> 39:22.440
This is just the beginning.

39:36.080 --> 39:36.990
Yuanzhong,

39:38.040 --> 39:40.630
we'll be back!

39:43.690 --> 39:44.560
Chiyi!

39:45.410 --> 39:46.570
Could this be the War Demons'

39:46.610 --> 39:47.580
possessing technique?

39:48.020 --> 39:49.780
Go to Tianqu Peak and find Elder Dingxu now!

39:49.810 --> 39:50.450
-Got it. -Got it.
